[task-01] Make a changed test-evidence rating justify itself. When a review repeated
    over stored earlier state judges a criterion again, the judge is told what the
    rating was and what changed about that criterion's dependencies, and a rating it
    moves must rest on one of the changes it was given.
    -> changed-rating-justifies-itself  [functional/explicit]
       A rating it moves must rest on one of the changes it was given.
    -> changed-test-evidence-rating-justify-itself  [test_demand/explicit]
       A changed test-evidence rating justify itself.

[constraint-01] A judgement asked for a criterion that changed is given the rating
    stored for that criterion.
    -> changed-criterion-gets-stored-rating  [functional/explicit]
       A judgement requested for a changed criterion includes the stored rating for that
       criterion.

[constraint-02] A judgement asked for a criterion that changed is given the changes to
